# seed-post — X/Twitter cookies (required)
# How to get these:
# 1. Open x.com in your browser while logged in
# 2. Open Developer Tools → Cookies → x.com
# 3. Copy auth_token and ct0 values
# 4. Paste below (no quotes, just the raw values)

AUTH_TOKEN=your_auth_token_here
CT0=your_ct0_csrf_token_here